OL,3,GNEWSAMother's sentence for toddler
OL,4,Adeath not increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who shook her two-year-old
OL,7,Fdaughter to death will not have her
OL,8,Fnine-year sentence increased after
OL,9,FCourt of Appeal judges ruled it was not
OL,10,F"unduly lenient".
OL,12,FMorsal Mohammed Naim, 33, of
OL,13,FLevenshulme, admitted manslaughter and
OL,14,Fchild cruelty after her daughter, Omra
OL,15,FWali Jan, suffered a catastrophic brain
OL,16,Finjury and later died.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
