OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMother's sentence for toddler
OL,4,Adeath not increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Attorney General referred the
OL,7,Fsentence imposed at Manchester Crown
OL,8,FCourt in February. However, three
OL,9,Fsenior judges rejected the challenge,
OL,10,Fdespite saying they would have imposed
OL,11,Fa longer term.
OL,13,FLord Justice Bean said the original
OL,14,Fsentence fell within the range
OL,15,Favailable to the trial judge and
OL,16,Fdescribed the circumstances of the case
OL,17,Fas "exceptional and extreme".
